<title>JAPAN: Tokyo corn futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo corn futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo corn futures market is closed on Monday due to a national holiday. Trading will be resumed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the market ended mixed. Prices ranged from 20 yen lower to 160 yen higher, with benchmark July 1998 ending up 10 yen at 13,710 yen a tonne.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
